{"2886320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinicrypt", "steam_appid": 2886320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4582620], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil lich as old as time itself lurks beneath the earth in ever-shifting halls. There they wait, building their horde of undead so that they may rule the world once again... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the lich can enact their plan, mighty heroes rise to face the most infamous dungeon of them all: the <strong>INFINICRYPT</strong>!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three heroes, all with unique abilities, and dare to delve deeper and deeper. Will you pick the stalwart knight, the explosive mage, or the crafty rogue? Collect great riches and powerful artifacts unique to each character, ensuring no run will be the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you might find altars to long forgotten gods and strange merchants where you might spend your newly acquired riches. Hearing their first prayer in centuries, you might find yourself to be the champion of dead gods! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way past hordes of undead and monsters wandering the halls. Fight the flesh and bones that lurk in the darkness, destroy their soul gems and ensure they never come back from the dead. Beware the squeal of the ratmen, for you aren't the only ones who have heard of the riches...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey to defeat the lich, you must face off against the Lords of Death that serve them! Strike them down to draw out the lich themself!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil lich as old as time itself lurks beneath the earth in ever-shifting halls. There they wait, building their horde of undead so that they may rule the world once again... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the lich can enact their plan, mighty heroes rise to face the most infamous dungeon of them all: the <strong>INFINICRYPT</strong>!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/3bab61680e9348fc031f1a4f5612e0e7.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three heroes, all with unique abilities, and dare to delve deeper and deeper. Will you pick the stalwart knight, the explosive mage, or the crafty rogue? Collect great riches and powerful artifacts unique to each character, ensuring no run will be the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/a218d882ef12bd17cc3f4d496ffaf183.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you might find altars to long forgotten gods and strange merchants where you might spend your newly acquired riches. Hearing their first prayer in centuries, you might find yourself to be the champion of dead gods! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/9a7b3567c88dc14b2d15c2f56a1e4874.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way past hordes of undead and monsters wandering the halls. Fight the flesh and bones that lurk in the darkness, destroy their soul gems and ensure they never come back from the dead. Beware the squeal of the ratmen, for you aren't the only ones who have heard of the riches...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.poster.avif?t=1775349350\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.webm?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/extras/51d21ab0a7d44d0c1aa6a6ffb2c7602c.mp4?t=1775349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey to defeat the lich, you must face off against the Lords of Death that serve them! Strike them down to draw out the lich themself!</p>", "short_description": "Three heroes. Three entirely different games. Master unique abilities, dodge relentless bullet-hell attacks, and fight your way through ever-changing halls. Are you ready for the infinite depths?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/header.jpg?t=1775349350", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775349350", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775349350", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 85 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Brett Page"], "publishers": ["Brett Page"], "demos": [{"appid": 3498440, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1249, "final": 1249, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$12.49"}, "packages": [1029067], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Infinicrypt", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1029067, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_sav